{"version":1,"content":"<p>Lexar發佈Professional SILVER GO microSDXC UHS-I存儲卡，面向運動相機、無人機、掌機和內容創作者，提供64GB、128GB、256GB和512GB四種容量。該卡採用V30視頻速度等級，Lexar稱可支持最高4K 60幀視頻錄製，也適用於連拍照片和掌機遊戲擴容。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583580.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T14:04:40.477600+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":155,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T13:38:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T13:58:09.629476+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T13:58:09.629476+00:00","content_hash":"7940db016ab86ec2d53d70547a7407af79e4af201bdc419272f1e0425c4ef8c0","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}